ly matches depreciation (1.3x, 6.8% of sales), a maintenance pace.","Its Rule of 40 score is 15, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 1.4%, and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insider trading is two-way: 2 purchases and 2 sales over the past year, net $14.0M sold.","The share count has grown 0.9% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","Short interest is elevated at 13.3% of the float, 5.1 days to cover."],"people":["With about 10,469 employees, each generates about $447K of revenue, 1.2x the Consumer Cyclical median, and productivity has risen 16.5% a year.","That works out to $6K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.7M (6x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $3K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":55,"head":"Avoid: priced 152% above its fair value of $20.38.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 41, gates 9/26)","Revenue grew 14.1%/yr over 5y","Net cash of $196.3M"],"cons":["Trades 152% above fair value of $20.38","P/FCF 83.4x vs sector 16.5x","12-1 month momentum -20%"],"flags":["Priced 152% above its fair value of $20.38"],"need":[],"buy_below":17.32,"vc":{"base":20.38,"base_src":"dcf","bear":12.45,"bull":32.38,"alt_median":23.16,"n_alt":2,"gap":-0.1203,"dispersion":0.1823,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":19.2575,"ev_ebitda":11.198,"pfcf":16.4664,"pb":2.375,"roic":0.1281,"gross_margin":0.3475,"fcf_margin":0.0624,"div_yield":0.0228}},"ticker":"FND","date":"2026-11-06"}